* =============================================================================
* 800 V DC-link component-level models for LTspice XVII / 24.x
* Model ID: EV-DCL-LTS-005, revision A
* =============================================================================
* These are engineering proxy models assembled from primitive electrical
* components. They are not encrypted or supplier-correlated vendor models.
* No B-source and no time-dependent R=if() contact model is used.
*
* The contactors have:
*   - an R-L electromagnetic coil;
*   - a zero-volt current-sense element;
*   - coil-current-to-force transduction (H source);
*   - an R-C armature delay;
*   - pickup/dropout hysteresis;
*   - a separate auxiliary contact;
*   - contact resistance and path inductance.
*
* Electrical contacts in every SPICE implementation require a switching
* primitive. Here the S element represents the mechanical contact boundary;
* it is driven only by the simulated coil/armature state, never directly by
* a command voltage.

* ----- Semiconductor primitives --------------------------------------------
.model NDRV60 VDMOS(Rg=2 Vto=2.5 Rd=6m Rs=5m Rb=20m Kp=40
+ Cgdmax=350p Cgdmin=35p Cgs=1.5n Cjo=900p Is=1n Vds=60 Ron=20m)

.model NLOGIC VDMOS(Rg=5 Vto=2.5 Rd=1 Rs=1 Rb=5 Kp=.25
+ Cgdmax=30p Cgdmin=5p Cgs=60p Cjo=30p Is=1n Vds=60 Ron=4)

.model SIC1200_DISCHARGE VDMOS(Rg=4 Vto=3.6 Rd=70m Rs=35m Rb=.2 Kp=12
+ Cgdmax=500p Cgdmin=25p Cgs=2.2n Cjo=1.1n Is=1n Vds=1200 Ron=120m)

.model QNPN NPN(Is=1e-14 Bf=160 Vaf=100 Ikf=.2 Rc=.5 Re=.2 Rb=20
+ Cje=12p Cjc=4p Tf=.45n Tr=25n)
.model QPNP PNP(Is=1e-14 Bf=120 Vaf=80 Ikf=.1 Rc=.8 Re=.3 Rb=25
+ Cje=14p Cjc=5p Tf=.7n Tr=35n)
.model DFLY D(Is=1n Rs=35m N=1.15 Cjo=220p M=.35 Tt=450n Bv=100 Ibv=10u)
.model DLOGIC D(Is=2n Rs=.5 N=1.5 Cjo=5p Tt=8n Bv=75 Ibv=10u)
.model DZGATE D(Is=1n Rs=.5 N=1.3 Bv=18 Ibv=1m Cjo=120p)
.model DZCLAMP33 D(Is=1n Rs=.15 N=1.2 Bv=33 Ibv=1m Cjo=350p)

* ----- Contact switching primitives ----------------------------------------
* Nominal total main-path resistance is about 0.50 mOhm:
* 0.20 mOhm switch Ron + 0.30 mOhm explicit conductor resistance.
.model EV200_MAIN_CONTACT SW(Ron=.2m Roff=1T Vt=5 Vh=1)
.model EV200_AUX_CONTACT  SW(Ron=.1 Roff=1G Vt=5 Vh=1)
.model PRE_MAIN_CONTACT   SW(Ron=2m Roff=1T Vt=5 Vh=1)
.model PRE_AUX_CONTACT    SW(Ron=.15 Roff=1G Vt=5 Vh=1)
.model FAULT_CONTACT      SW(Ron=.1m Roff=1T Vt=2.5 Vh=.25)

* ----- EV200-class normally-open main contactor proxy ----------------------
* Pin order: HV_IN HV_OUT COIL+ COIL- AUX_IN AUX_OUT MECH_STATE
* Default winding data are engineering assumptions for an uneconomized
* 12 V / 1 A coil. Replace RCOIL and LCOIL with measured supplier values.
.subckt EV200_COIL_CONTACTOR HVIN HVOUT CP CM AIN AOUT STATE
+ params: RCOIL=12 LCOIL=80m RPATH=.3m LPATH=80n
+ KFORCE=12 RMECH=10k CMECH=.8u
RCOIL CP C1 {RCOIL}
LCOIL C1 C2 {LCOIL}
VCOIL_SENSE C2 CM 0
HFORCE FORCE 0 VCOIL_SENSE {KFORCE}
RARM FORCE STATE {RMECH}
CARM STATE 0 {CMECH} ic=0
SMAIN HVIN CMAIN STATE 0 EV200_MAIN_CONTACT
RMAIN CMAIN LMID {RPATH}
LMAIN LMID HVOUT {LPATH}
SAUX AIN AOUT STATE 0 EV200_AUX_CONTACT
RSTATE STATE 0 100Meg
.ends EV200_COIL_CONTACTOR

* ----- Normally-open precharge contactor proxy -----------------------------
* Pin order: HV_IN HV_OUT COIL+ COIL- AUX_IN AUX_OUT MECH_STATE
* Default winding: 12 V / 0.5 A engineering proxy.
.subckt PRECHARGE_COIL_CONTACTOR HVIN HVOUT CP CM AIN AOUT STATE
+ params: RCOIL=24 LCOIL=60m RPATH=3m LPATH=120n
+ KFORCE=24 RMECH=10k CMECH=.35u
RCOIL CP C1 {RCOIL}
LCOIL C1 C2 {LCOIL}
VCOIL_SENSE C2 CM 0
HFORCE FORCE 0 VCOIL_SENSE {KFORCE}
RARM FORCE STATE {RMECH}
CARM STATE 0 {CMECH} ic=0
SMAIN HVIN CMAIN STATE 0 PRE_MAIN_CONTACT
RMAIN CMAIN LMID {RPATH}
LMAIN LMID HVOUT {LPATH}
SAUX AIN AOUT STATE 0 PRE_AUX_CONTACT
RSTATE STATE 0 100Meg
.ends PRECHARGE_COIL_CONTACTOR

* ----- Protected low-side contactor coil driver ----------------------------
* Pin order: COIL_LOW COMMAND CONTROL_GND
* The MOSFET, gate impedance, pulldown and 18 V Vgs clamp are explicit.
* The winding flyback diode is placed outside this subcircuit so clamp type
* can be selected independently for each contactor.
.subckt COIL_LOW_SIDE_DRIVER DRAIN COMMAND GND
RGATE COMMAND GATE 100
RPD GATE GND 10k
DZGS GND GATE DZGATE
MDRV DRAIN GATE GND GND NDRV60
.ends COIL_LOW_SIDE_DRIVER

* ----- Transistor-level differential threshold comparator -----------------
* Pin order: NONINV INV OUT VCC GND
* OUT is high when NONINV > INV. This is intentionally transparent and
* replaceable by an automotive comparator macro-model during supplier design.
.subckt DISCRETE_COMPARATOR NONINV INV OUT VCC GND
RPD1 C1 GND 4.7k
RPD2 OUT GND 4.7k
Q1 C1 NONINV ET QPNP
Q2 OUT INV ET QPNP
RTAIL VCC ET 330
CCOMP C1 OUT 22p
RBIAS1 NONINV GND 100Meg
RBIAS2 INV GND 100Meg
.ends DISCRETE_COMPARATOR

* ----- Isolated active-discharge branch ------------------------------------
* Pin order: DC+ DC- ENABLE CONTROL_GND STATE
* A floating 15 V source represents the isolated bias rail. VLED/RLED and the
* current-controlled F source form an optocoupler proxy with galvanically
* separated input/output nodes. The power path is a 1200 V VDMOS plus a
* physical discharge resistor.
.subckt ACTIVE_DISCHARGE DCPLUS DCMINUS ENABLE CGND STATE
+ params: RDIS=1k
VISO15 VISO DCMINUS 15
VLED ENABLE LED_A 0
RLED LED_A CGND 1k
FPHOTO NDRV DCMINUS VLED 1
RISO VISO NDRV 10k
DISOCLAMP DCMINUS NDRV DLOGIC
RQG NDRV QB 10k
RQB QB DCMINUS 100k
QGATE STATE QB DCMINUS QNPN
RGUP VISO STATE 1k
RGDN STATE DCMINUS 100k
DZDIS DCMINUS STATE DZGATE
RDIS DCPLUS DIS_D {RDIS}
MDIS DIS_D STATE DCMINUS DCMINUS SIC1200_DISCHARGE
.ends ACTIVE_DISCHARGE

